880
01:51:18.658 --> 01:51:21.658
The holy God, the perfect God.

881
01:51:21.658 --> 01:51:25.658
Without simplicity, without spot or wrinkle, without fault.

882
01:51:25.658 --> 01:51:28.658
Completely perfect, completely beautiful.

883
01:51:28.658 --> 01:51:31.658
That is where we can come.

884
01:51:31.658 --> 01:51:34.658
And it is through Jesus.

885
01:51:34.658 --> 01:51:37.658
Everything revolves around Jesus.

886
01:51:37.658 --> 01:51:40.658
Without Jesus, that veil would still be there.

887
01:51:40.658 --> 01:51:43.658
Without Jesus, we would not be able to come to God at all.

888
01:51:43.658 --> 01:51:45.658
But through Jesus.

889
01:51:45.658 --> 01:51:51.658
By believing and accepting what happened at the cross.

890
01:51:51.658 --> 01:51:55.658
You can come to God.

891
