And what happens then.

892
01:51:58.658 --> 01:52:01.658
Is that you stand before God.

893
01:52:01.658 --> 01:52:04.658
While you are completely perfect.

894
01:52:04.658 --> 01:52:07.658
I mean that seriously.

895
01:52:07.658 --> 01:52:09.658
That is the only way to come to God.

896
01:52:09.658 --> 01:52:11.658
God has not changed one millimeter.

897
01:52:11.658 --> 01:52:13.658
God is still holy.

898
01:52:13.658 --> 01:52:16.658
God can have no fellowship.

899
01:52:16.658 --> 01:52:19.658
With uncleanness, with sin.

900
01:52:19.658 --> 01:52:22.658
With unholiness, with imperfection.

901
01:52:22.658 --> 01:52:26.658
But at the moment we come through Jesus.

902
01:52:26.658 --> 01:52:28.658
When we accept Jesus.

903
