910
01:52:44.658 --> 01:52:47.658
And because of that, you can come to God.

911
01:52:47.658 --> 01:52:49.658
And then you stand before him.

912
01:52:49.658 --> 01:52:51.658
However you may see him.

913
01:52:51.658 --> 01:52:53.658
Completely perfect.

914
01:52:53.658 --> 01:52:56.658
