931
01:53:36.658 --> 01:53:38.658
Jesus had, in a moment.

932
01:53:38.658 --> 01:53:40.658
Once and for all.

933
01:53:40.658 --> 01:53:42.658
All that holiness fulfilled.

934
01:53:45.658 --> 01:53:47.658
So Jesus is our high priest.

935
01:53:47.658 --> 01:53:51.658
