937
01:53:54.658 --> 01:53:56.658
He will receive us.

938
01:53:56.658 --> 01:53:58.658
Why? Because we are completely perfect.

939
01:53:58.658 --> 01:54:01.658
Why? Because Jesus is completely perfect.

940
01:54:02.658 --> 01:54:06.658
For our hearts have been cleansed by the blood of Jesus.

941
01:54:07.658 --> 01:54:09.658
Hallelujah.

942
01:54:09.658 --> 01:54:11.658
Hallelujah.

943
01:54:11.658 --> 01:54:14.658
So the whole argument was not.

944
01:54:14.658 --> 01:54:18.658
So that we will remember how that whole priesthood worked.

945
01:54:18.658 --> 01:54:20.658
And the tabernacle and so on.

946
01:54:22.658 --> 01:54:25.658
I want to indicate how holy God is.

947
01:54:25.658 --> 01:54:28.658
And how unimaginable it is.

948
01:54:28.658 --> 01:54:30.658
What happened at the cross.

949
01:54:30.658 --> 01:54:32.658
Thank you Jesus.

950
01:54:32.658 --> 01:54:34.658
Hallelujah.

951
01:54:34.658 --> 01:54:37.658
This is indescribable.

952
01:54:37.658 --> 01:54:40.658
And we sometimes handle it far too lightly.

953
01:54:40.658 --> 01:54:43.658
For there is grace.

954
01:54:43.658 --> 01:54:47.658
But it cost Jesus everything.

955
01:54:47.658 --> 01:54:49.658
Hallelujah.

956
01:54:49.658 --> 01:54:51.658
So.

957
