964
01:55:21.658 --> 01:55:24.658
Everything was meant to help us towards God.

965
01:55:24.658 --> 01:55:26.658
So that we wouldn't just be messing around.

966
01:55:27.658 --> 01:55:31.658
But that we would live in intimacy with God.

967
01:55:31.658 --> 01:55:33.658
In fact.

968
01:55:33.658 --> 01:55:35.658
That is why He created you.

969
01:55:35.658 --> 01:55:37.658
