977
01:55:57.658 --> 01:56:00.658
He had already thought of you and designed you.

978
01:56:00.658 --> 01:56:02.658
Why?

979
01:56:02.658 --> 01:56:04.658
Because He thinks you are awesome.

980
01:56:04.658 --> 01:56:06.658
