981
01:56:06.658 --> 01:56:08.658
He wants to be intimate with you.

982
01:56:08.658 --> 01:56:10.658
He wants to know you.

983
01:56:10.658 --> 01:56:13.658
He wants you to live your life the way He wants.

984
01:56:13.658 --> 01:56:15.658
That He may be honored.

985
01:56:15.658 --> 01:56:17.658
That people around you may be blessed.

986
01:56:17.658 --> 01:56:19.658
That is what He wants.

987
01:56:19.658 --> 01:56:22.658
That was the whole purpose of the law.

988
01:56:22.658 --> 01:56:25.658
So it is important that we do not say.

