02:11:29.658 --> 02:11:30.658
11?

1278
02:11:30.658 --> 02:11:32.658
11 people are getting baptized.

1279
02:11:32.658 --> 02:11:34.658
And that is really wonderful.

1280
02:11:34.658 --> 02:11:35.658
Hallelujah.

1281
02:11:35.658 --> 02:11:36.658
Praise here.

1282
02:11:36.658 --> 02:11:38.658
So 11 people are going to be baptized.

1283
02:11:38.658 --> 02:11:41.658
This coming Wednesday we have a final new start.

1284
02:11:41.658 --> 02:11:42.658
Evening with them.

1285
02:11:42.658 --> 02:11:46.658
We are going to explain to them how it works.

1286
02:11:46.658 --> 02:11:48.658
I am looking forward to it.

1287
02:11:48.658 --> 02:11:49.658
Make sure you are there.

1288
02:11:49.658 --> 02:11:51.658
I want to say one more thing.

1289
02:11:51.658 --> 02:11:55.658
As a housekeeping matter.

1290
02:11:55.658 --> 02:11:57.658
Please, this coming Sunday.

1291
02:11:57.658 --> 02:11:59.658
We start at 10:30 AM.

1292
02:11:59.658 --> 02:12:02.658
So let's also start together at 10:30 AM.

1293
02:12:02.658 --> 02:12:04.658
Some time ago I said this once.

1294
02:12:04.658 --> 02:12:09.658
And then I can just see in the church that people are motivated.

1295
02:12:09.658 --> 02:12:11.658
And actually there at 10:30 AM.

1296
02:12:11.658 --> 02:12:14.658
And that fades a bit over the weeks.

1297
02:12:14.658 --> 02:12:16.658
But Jesus is worth more than that.

1298
02:12:16.658 --> 02:12:19.658
And I often see at 10:30 AM.

1299
02:12:19.658 --> 02:12:21.658
And this morning was quite extreme, I must say.

1300
02:12:21.658 --> 02:12:23.658
Then I look into the room.

1301
02:12:23.658 --> 02:12:28.658
And then I see that the room will fill up by at least 30% throughout the service.

1302
02:12:28.658 --> 02:12:32.658
And I think that Jesus is already worthy of our first song. Amen.

1303
02:12:32.658 --> 02:12:36.658
So that piece of discipline we must be able to bring together.

1304
02:12:36.658 --> 02:12:40.658
That as soon as at 10:27, as soon as that pre-roll starts.

1305
02:12:40.658 --> 02:12:43.658
That we are ready, that we have had our coffee.

1306
02:12:43.658 --> 02:12:46.658
That we have said hello to each other.

1307
02:12:46.658 --> 02:12:48.658
And then we start together from song 1.

1308
02:12:48.658 --> 02:12:51.658
Not chatting with each other during the song about how things are.

1309
02:12:51.658 --> 02:12:54.658
But from song 1 we give Him our whole everything.

1310
02:12:54.658 --> 02:12:56.658
Is that a good agreement? Alright, cool.

1311
02:12:56.658 --> 02:13:01.658
Father in heaven, I thank You for this wonderful week that lies ahead of us.

1312
02:13:01.658 --> 02:13:04.658
I know that the coming week is great because You are there.

1313
02:13:04.658 --> 02:13:06.658
Lord, and I am looking forward to the coming weeks.

1314
02:13:06.658 --> 02:13:09.658
And I bless us as a church in the name of Jesus.

1315
02:13:09.658 --> 02:13:14.658
That those people who go to work, that they go to work together with You.

1316
02:13:14.658 --> 02:13:19.658
That the people who have school, even though I believe for many it is Easter break.

1317
02:13:19.658 --> 02:13:22.658
But whatever it is, wherever we go.

1318
02:13:22.658 --> 02:13:25.658
Lord, that we will go with King Jesus.

1319
02:13:25.658 --> 02:13:27.658
For He is our Lord. Amen.

1320
02:13:27.658 --> 02:13:28.658
Amen.

1321
02:13:28.658 --> 02:13:30.658
We'll see you tomorrow at prayer.

1322
02:13:30.658 --> 02:13:31.658
Bye bye.
